1.	U. H. Lyons, Master; E. Nickerson, Mate; J. A. Ledingham, Chief Engineer; W. Curry, Second Engineer; C. Hannon, Operator; G. Jollimore, Assistant Operator;
A.	McDonald, Assistant Operator; H. McKinnon, Boatswain; U. Rafuse, Cook; W. Abbott, Steward; W. Hopkins, Oiler; W. Oaks, Oiler; E. Marden, Oiler; R. Bone, Fireman; H. Campbell, Fireman; .T. Brownrigg, Fireman; D. MeCrie, Fireman;
B.	Abbott, Night Watch; A. Rafuse, Deck Hand; T. Wood, Deck Hand; J. Montague, Deck Hand; G. Little, Deck Hand; H. Mills, Deck Hand; J. Dalton, Deck Hand;
J.	Hansford, Deck Hand; G. Chambers, Deck Hand.
The department does not keep a record of the changes in residence of the men employed on the dredges, and I am unable to answer that part of the question which asks for the places of residences (which, 1 assume, means the present places of residence) of the crew, officers and men.
2.	Watchmen.
